 "note": "CY54/74FCT646T print CPAB/CPBA for the clocks and G for the output enable (cy74fct646t p.1-2; same PDF as cy54fct646t); same positions as 74_646 CLKAB/CLKBA/OE. p24 from cy74fct646t p.1 (Q = DBQ, SO = DW, CY54 D). lccc28 = CY54FCT646T L package p.1 (5962-9222301M3A, FK): NC on 1, 8, 15, 22. Function table (all 646 PDFs): G H = isolation (both ports read, registers still clock); G L + DIR L: SBA L = real-time B to A, SBA H = stored B to A; G L + DIR H: SAB L = real-time A to B, SAB H = stored A to B; CPAB/CPBA rising edge stores the A/B bus whatever G/DIR are. (cy74fct646t p.2).",
